Remaining items before uploading to Debian
===========================================

* ITP bug number
  - debian/changelog: replace "#NNNNNN" in the Closes: entry with the
    bug number after filing the ITP against the wnpp pseudo-package.
    This clears the two remaining lintian warnings.

* Standards-Version
  - debian/control: set to the current Debian Policy version at upload
    time (currently 4.7.0).

The maintainer email used in debian/control and debian/changelog must
match the GPG key used to sign the upload.
